Package: hypermodR
Type: Package
Title: Hyperspectral Modelling and Validation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Raban", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Provides interpretable and black-box modelling of
    hyperspectral imaging data with explicit spectral, spatial and temporal
    data contracts, grouped validation, reproducible evaluation, optional
    isolated model runtimes and an interactive 'shiny' research workbench.
    Model and instrument qualification is recorded separately from interface
    availability.
